HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: HYDRAULIC STEERING RUDDER SLEW RATE GOVERNOR
BTW Restricts angular velocity to 15 degrees per second
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A SLEW_RATE_LIMIT ITZ 15.0

HOW IZ I LIMIT_SLEW YR DELTA_DEG AN YR DT_S
    I HAS A MAX_DELTA ITZ PRODUKT OF SLEW_RATE_LIMIT AN DT_S
    I HAS A NEG_MAX ITZ PRODUKT OF -1.0 AN MAX_DELTA
    FOUND YR I IZ MATH_CLAMP YR DELTA_DEG AN YR NEG_MAX AN YR MAX_DELTA MKAY
IF U SAY SO

